<view class="form"><text class="title">有问题？有怪点子？告诉我。</text><picker range="{{types}}" bindchange="type"><view class="pick">{{types[typeIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><input maxlength="80" value="{{title}}" placeholder="一句话说说遇到的问题" data-key="title" bindinput="input"/><textarea maxlength="1500" value="{{detail}}" placeholder="怎么操作的？遇到了什么？你希望是什么效果？" data-key="detail" bindinput="input"/><button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="images">＋ 添加截图（最多3张）</button><view class="attachments"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="path"><image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">移除</text></view></view><text class="note">提交前会将文字和截图发送至微信检测；通过后保存到腾讯云，并公开同步到 GitHub Issue。请先遮挡截图中的私人信息。制作表情的照片不会自动附带。</text><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy||received}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{received?'反馈已收到':'提交反馈'}}</button><text class="note">{{status}}</text><button bindtap="copy" wx:if="{{failed}}">复制反馈网页地址</button></view>
